export anchor BootcampStyle:
    number: 393
    screen: FitnessTracker
    name: Bootcamp
    idea: The day issued as a typed orders sheet on an olive clipboard, with stencilled headings, numbered orders ticked off in boxes, a duty roster for the week, and DONE or OPEN stamped beside every goal in terse capitals.
    base: dark
    palette:
        olive: #20231a, the hatched page and the style sheet
        board: #2b2f20, the clipboards
        sheet: #33382a, the paper on each board, fields and list rows
        rule: #565c44, dashed lines between orders
        khaki: #e9e0bd, text, ticked boxes, table rules, the roster header and the primary button
        muted: #c2b994, labels, order numbers, empty boxes and done plan weeks
        drab: #8c936c, the second stripe in hatched log bars
        stamp: #ff8a74, OPEN stamps, the top zone, today's roster header, the current plan week and sheet labels
        go: #c7e08a, DONE stamps
        onKhaki: #1d1f14, text on khaki, muted and stamp fills
    type:
        Headings use Stencil, Stencil Std, Arial Black, Impact at 900 in
        caps tracked 0.12em, with a thin horizontal gap masked through the
        middle like a stencil bridge, 26px on sheets and 44px for big
        figures. Text uses Courier New, Courier, Nimbus Mono PS, ui-
        monospace at 15px and 1.55, orders 16px bold caps, labels 12px caps
        tracked 0.14em.
    layout:
        A diagonally hatched olive page. The header has Brightwork Move in
        stencil, a typed slash line reading daily orders and the date, and a
        boxed Today, Week and Plan switch with Today in khaki, ruled below
        by a 3px khaki line. Each section is a clipboard with a steel clip,
        a hard shadow and a paper sheet inside. Orders of the day has a memo
        block for date, unit and status, then four numbered orders. Orders
        01 to 03 are Move, Exercise and Stand, each a bold caps command, a
        typed status line ending Carry on, a row of tick boxes with X for
        done units, one box per 50 kcal, 5 min or 1 h, and a rotated red
        OPEN stamp. Order 04 is the Evening run with a green DONE stamp.
        Beside it, the After action report with Mission complete, a four
        cell form of distance, time, average pace and average heart rate,
        and an intensity log of hatched bars per zone, zone 3 in stamp red.
        A full width Duty roster table has days as columns, Saturday headed
        in stamp red with a star, and rows for load bars, km with dashed
        REST, and duty with X RUN or STAND DOWN, then the total. Last,
        Lights out with 7 h 12 min and deep sleep, and Campaign half
        marathon with Week 6 of 12, twelve numbered boxes, and Next order
        tomorrow Long run 14 km with View plan. Below 960px everything
        stacks and the roster scrolls inside its sheet. At 375px stamps drop
        under their order.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 28px between boards, 22 to 24px paper padding, 14px per order.
    density: Medium high. Orders, a report form, a roster table and two short notes.
    corners: None. Square boards, boxes, stamps and buttons.
    borders: 2px khaki rules on forms and tables, dashed rules between orders and double stamp borders.
    shadows: Hard 4 to 6px offset shadows under clipboards and the primary button.
    icons:
        Tick boxes filled with an X for done units and empty for to go.
        Stamps read OPEN with an empty square or DONE with a crossed square.
        Rest days read REST with a dash and STAND DOWN. Today has a star.
    focus: A 3px khaki outline, an olive gap and a 2px stamp coloured ring outside.
    tone: Terse orders in capitals such as Carry on, Mission complete, Lights out and Next order.
